versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory

alreadyPersisted.description:
If true, this batch did nothing since an {@link AssetClass} was already persisted with the
`definitionVersion.file` of this batch. If {@link ReliabilityAssetClassDefinitionParserJobOptions#shouldOverwrite}
is true, this will always be false.
